        dho:Condition ;
    owl:sameAs dho:c-m1 ;
    skos:note "How the heart's release by love is developed (12.1-12.3). The Pali: each awakening factor developed accompanied by love. Sujato's English: 'develops the heart's release by love together with the awakening factors'."@en ;
    dho:citedBy dho:p-sn46.54-12.1,
        dho:p-sn46.54-12.2,
        dho:p-sn46.54-12.3 ;
    dho:condition dho:Love ;
    dho:conditioned dho:SevenAwakeningFactors ;
    dho:relation dho:Accompanies ;
    dho:wording "mettāsahagataṁ" .

dho:c-m2 a owl:Thing,
        dho:Condition ;
    owl:sameAs dho:c-m2 ;
    skos:note "How the heart's release by compassion is developed (13.1-13.3). The Pali: each awakening factor developed accompanied by compassion."@en ;
    dho:citedBy dho:p-sn46.54-13.1,
        dho:p-sn46.54-13.2,
        dho:p-sn46.54-13.3 ;
    dho:condition dho:Compassion ;
    dho:conditioned dho:SevenAwakeningFactors ;
    dho:relation dho:Accompanies ;
    dho:wording "karuṇāsahagataṁ" .

dho:c-m3 a owl:Thing,
        dho:Condition ;
    owl:sameAs dho:c-m3 ;
    skos:note "How the heart's release by rejoicing is developed (14.1-14.3). The Pali: each awakening factor developed accompanied by rejoicing."@en ;
    dho:citedBy dho:p-sn46.54-14.1,
        dho:p-sn46.54-14.2,
        dho:p-sn46.54-14.3 ;
    dho:condition dho:Rejoicing ;
    dho:conditioned dho:SevenAwakeningFactors ;
    dho:relation dho:Accompanies ;
    dho:wording "muditāsahagataṁ" .

dho:c-m4 a owl:Thing,
        dho:Condition ;
    owl:sameAs dho:c-m4 ;
    skos:note "How the heart's release by equanimity is developed (15.1-15.3). The Pali even has 'the awakening factor of equanimity accompanied by equanimity' (upekkhāsahagataṁ upekkhāsambojjhaṅgaṁ, 15.3): the practice and the factor are two things here, which supports keeping them as separate concepts (D15)."@en ;
    dho:citedBy dho:p-sn46.54-15.1,
        dho:p-sn46.54-15.2,
        dho:p-sn46.54-15.3 ;
    dho:condition dho:EquanimityImmeasurable ;
    dho:conditioned dho:SevenAwakeningFactors ;
    dho:relation dho:Accompanies ;
    dho:wording "upekkhāsahagataṁ" .

