"Derived by rule R1: the same object, attended to rationally, both fuels this awakening factor and starves that hindrance (SN 46.51). The sutta never states it directly."@en owl:sameAs "Derived by rule R1: the same object, attended to rationally, both fuels this awakening factor and starves that hindrance (SN 46.51). The sutta never states it directly."@en .

"Desire for rebirth in the realm of luminous form, desire for rebirth in the formless realm, conceit, restlessness, and ignorance."@en owl:sameAs "Desire for rebirth in the realm of luminous form, desire for rebirth in the formless realm, conceit, restlessness, and ignorance."@en .

"Dhamma ontology (v0.1)"@en owl:sameAs "Dhamma ontology (v0.1)"@en .

