"Division"@en owl:sameAs "Division"@en .

"Doubt about internal things is a hindrance; and doubt about external things is also a hindrance."@en owl:sameAs "Doubt about internal things is a hindrance; and doubt about external things is also a hindrance."@en .

"Dullness is a hindrance; and drowsiness is also a hindrance."@en owl:sameAs "Dullness is a hindrance; and drowsiness is also a hindrance."@en .

"Editor's judgment (this project)"@en owl:sameAs "Editor's judgment (this project)"@en .

"Effect"@en owl:sameAs "Effect"@en .

