"Prevents the quality arising, or its growth once arisen (anāhāra)."@en owl:sameAs "Prevents the quality arising, or its growth once arisen (anāhāra)."@en .

"Putting out a great fire with wet fuel, water and dirt: the restless mind and the right factors."@en owl:sameAs "Putting out a great fire with wet fuel, water and dirt: the restless mind and the right factors."@en .

"Quoted as evidence (e.g. for a word sense); its teaching is not modelled."@en owl:sameAs "Quoted as evidence (e.g. for a word sense); its teaching is not modelled."@en .

"Ranked alternatives, one of which can be expected: each later fruit applies 'if not' the one before (9.3-9.9). Fruits 3-7 come 'with the ending of the five lower fetters'."@en owl:sameAs "Ranked alternatives, one of which can be expected: each later fruit applies 'if not' the one before (9.3-9.9). Fruits 3-7 come 'with the ending of the five lower fetters'."@en .

"Rapture while placing the mind and keeping it connected is the awakening factor of rapture; and rapture without placing the mind and keeping it connected is also the awakening factor of rapture."@en owl:sameAs "Rapture while placing the mind and keeping it connected is the awakening factor of rapture; and rapture without placing the mind and keeping it connected is also the awakening factor of rapture."@en .

