"Sense of dhamma here is contested; deliberately left unassigned in v0.1."@en owl:sameAs "Sense of dhamma here is contested; deliberately left unassigned in v0.1."@en .

"Sensual desire for what is internal is a hindrance; and sensual desire for what is external is also a hindrance."@en owl:sameAs "Sensual desire for what is internal is a hindrance; and sensual desire for what is external is also a hindrance."@en .

