"If they toss dry grass, cow-dung, and timber on it, blow on it, and don’t scatter dirt on it," owl:sameAs "If they toss dry grass, cow-dung, and timber on it, blow on it, and don’t scatter dirt on it," .

"If they toss wet grass, cow-dung, and timber on it, spray it with water, and scatter dirt on it," owl:sameAs "If they toss wet grass, cow-dung, and timber on it, spray it with water, and scatter dirt on it," .

"Mendicants, the dawn is the forerunner and harbinger of the sunrise." owl:sameAs "Mendicants, the dawn is the forerunner and harbinger of the sunrise." .

"enlightenment in this very life" owl:sameAs "enlightenment in this very life" .

"great benefit" owl:sameAs "great benefit" .

"great ease" owl:sameAs "great ease" .

"great inspiration" owl:sameAs "great inspiration" .

"great sanctuary from the yoke" owl:sameAs "great sanctuary from the yoke" .

"non-return" owl:sameAs "non-return" .

"pays attention, applies the mind, concentrates wholeheartedly, and actively listens to the teaching" owl:sameAs "pays attention, applies the mind, concentrates wholeheartedly, and actively listens to the teaching" .

"A mendicant accomplished in rational application of mind can expect to develop and cultivate the seven awakening factors."@en owl:sameAs "A mendicant accomplished in rational application of mind can expect to develop and cultivate the seven awakening factors."@en .

"A mendicant develops the awakening factor of equanimity, which relies on seclusion, fading away, and cessation, and ripens as letting go. And it is abundant, expansive, limitless, and free of ill will."@en owl:sameAs "A mendicant develops the awakening factor of equanimity, which relies on seclusion, fading away, and cessation, and ripens as letting go. And it is abundant, expansive, limitless, and free of ill will."@en .

"A mendicant with good friends can expect to develop and cultivate the seven awakening factors."@en owl:sameAs "A mendicant with good friends can expect to develop and cultivate the seven awakening factors."@en .

"If they toss dry grass, cow-dung, and timber on it, blow on it, and don’t scatter dirt on it,"@en owl:sameAs "If they toss dry grass, cow-dung, and timber on it, blow on it, and don’t scatter dirt on it,"@en .

"If they toss wet grass, cow-dung, and timber on it, spray it with water, and scatter dirt on it,"@en owl:sameAs "If they toss wet grass, cow-dung, and timber on it, spray it with water, and scatter dirt on it,"@en .

"In the same way, for a mendicant good friendship is the forerunner and harbinger of the arising of the seven awakening factors."@en owl:sameAs "In the same way, for a mendicant good friendship is the forerunner and harbinger of the arising of the seven awakening factors."@en .

"In the same way, the five hindrances are sustained by fuel. They depend on fuel to continue, and without fuel they don’t continue."@en owl:sameAs "In the same way, the five hindrances are sustained by fuel. They depend on fuel to continue, and without fuel they don’t continue."@en .

"It’s when a mendicant develops the awakening factors of mindfulness, investigation of principles, energy, rapture, tranquility, immersion,"@en owl:sameAs "It’s when a mendicant develops the awakening factors of mindfulness, investigation of principles, energy, rapture, tranquility, immersion,"@en .

"Sensual desire,"@en owl:sameAs "Sensual desire,"@en .

"Suppose someone wanted to extinguish a great mass of fire."@en owl:sameAs "Suppose someone wanted to extinguish a great mass of fire."@en .

"Suppose someone wanted to make a small fire flare up."@en owl:sameAs "Suppose someone wanted to make a small fire flare up."@en .

"The awakening factors of mindfulness, investigation of principles, energy, rapture, tranquility, immersion, and equanimity.”"@en owl:sameAs "The awakening factors of mindfulness, investigation of principles, energy, rapture, tranquility, immersion, and equanimity.”"@en .

"There are things that are grounds for doubt."@en owl:sameAs "There are things that are grounds for doubt."@en .

"There is discontent, sloth, yawning, sleepiness after eating, and mental sluggishness."@en owl:sameAs "There is discontent, sloth, yawning, sleepiness after eating, and mental sluggishness."@en .

"There is the feature of aversion."@en owl:sameAs "There is the feature of aversion."@en .

"There is the feature of beauty."@en owl:sameAs "There is the feature of beauty."@en .

"There is the unsettled mind."@en owl:sameAs "There is the unsettled mind."@en .

"These are the seven awakening factors that I’ve rightly explained. When developed and cultivated, they lead to direct knowledge, to awakening, and to extinguishment.”"@en owl:sameAs "These are the seven awakening factors that I’ve rightly explained. When developed and cultivated, they lead to direct knowledge, to awakening, and to extinguishment.”"@en .

"They’re called awakening factors because they lead to awakening.”"@en owl:sameAs "They’re called awakening factors because they lead to awakening.”"@en .

"This is a cause and reason for knowing and seeing."@en owl:sameAs "This is a cause and reason for knowing and seeing."@en .

"This is a cause and reason for not knowing and not seeing."@en owl:sameAs "This is a cause and reason for not knowing and not seeing."@en .

"and doubt."@en owl:sameAs "and doubt."@en .

"awakening"@en owl:sameAs "awakening"@en .

"could they extinguish it?”"@en owl:sameAs "could they extinguish it?”"@en .

"could they make it flare up?”"@en owl:sameAs "could they make it flare up?”"@en .

"equanimity"@en owl:sameAs "equanimity"@en .

"fuels the arising of doubt, or, when it has arisen, makes it increase and grow."@en owl:sameAs "fuels the arising of doubt, or, when it has arisen, makes it increase and grow."@en .

"fuels the arising of dullness and drowsiness, or, when they have arisen, makes them increase and grow."@en owl:sameAs "fuels the arising of dullness and drowsiness, or, when they have arisen, makes them increase and grow."@en .

"fuels the arising of ill will, or, when it has arisen, makes it increase and grow."@en owl:sameAs "fuels the arising of ill will, or, when it has arisen, makes it increase and grow."@en .

"fuels the arising of restlessness and remorse, or, when they have arisen, makes them increase and grow."@en owl:sameAs "fuels the arising of restlessness and remorse, or, when they have arisen, makes them increase and grow."@en .

"fuels the arising of sensual desire, or, when it has arisen, makes it increase and grow."@en owl:sameAs "fuels the arising of sensual desire, or, when it has arisen, makes it increase and grow."@en .

"fuels the arising of the awakening factor of energy, or, when it has arisen, fully develops it."@en owl:sameAs "fuels the arising of the awakening factor of energy, or, when it has arisen, fully develops it."@en .

"fuels the arising of the awakening factor of equanimity, or, when it has arisen, fully develops it."@en owl:sameAs "fuels the arising of the awakening factor of equanimity, or, when it has arisen, fully develops it."@en .

"fuels the arising of the awakening factor of immersion, or, when it has arisen, fully develops it."@en owl:sameAs "fuels the arising of the awakening factor of immersion, or, when it has arisen, fully develops it."@en .

"fuels the arising of the awakening factor of investigation of principles, or, when it has arisen, fully develops it."@en owl:sameAs "fuels the arising of the awakening factor of investigation of principles, or, when it has arisen, fully develops it."@en .

"fuels the arising of the awakening factor of mindfulness, or, when it has arisen, fully develops it."@en owl:sameAs "fuels the arising of the awakening factor of mindfulness, or, when it has arisen, fully develops it."@en .

"fuels the arising of the awakening factor of rapture, or, when it has arisen, fully develops it."@en owl:sameAs "fuels the arising of the awakening factor of rapture, or, when it has arisen, fully develops it."@en .

"fuels the arising of the awakening factor of tranquility, or, when it has arisen, fully develops it."@en owl:sameAs "fuels the arising of the awakening factor of tranquility, or, when it has arisen, fully develops it."@en .

"monkey mind"@en owl:sameAs "monkey mind"@en .

"restless"@en owl:sameAs "restless"@en .

"restlessness"@en owl:sameAs "restlessness"@en .

"sleepy"@en owl:sameAs "sleepy"@en .

