dho:t-sn46.48 a owl:Thing,
        dho:Text ;
    dct:license <https://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/> ;
    dct:source "SuttaCentral bilara-data: English by Bhikkhu Sujato, Pali Mahāsaṅgīti edition" ;
    owl:sameAs dho:t-sn46.48 ;
    skos:prefLabel "SN 46.48 Ādiccasutta — The Sun"@en ;
    dho:coverage dho:FullyEncoded ;
    dho:encodes "Good friendship is the forerunner of the arising of the seven factors (1.2), and one with good friends can expect to develop them (1.3); the stock formula for each factor (relies on seclusion, fading away and cessation; ripens as letting go) (1.6). Same statements as SN 46.12, added as citations. The simile of the dawn (1.1; D22)." ;
    dho:layer dho:SuttaLayer ;
    dho:modelledBy "project owner with Claude (AI assistant), from SuttaCentral's text" ;
    dho:modelledOn "2026-11-14"^^xsd:date ;
    dho:review dho:Unreviewed ;
    dho:url "https://suttacentral.net/sn46.48/en/sujato"^^xsd:anyURI .

dho:t-sn46.5 a owl:Thing,
        dho:Text ;
    dct:license <https://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/> ;
    dct:source "SuttaCentral bilara-data: English by Bhikkhu Sujato, Pali Mahāsaṅgīti edition" ;
    owl:sameAs dho:t-sn46.5 ;
    skos:prefLabel "SN 46.5 Bhikkhusutta — A Monk"@en ;
    dho:coverage dho:PartlyEncoded ;
    dho:encodes "Why they are called awakening factors: they lead to awakening (bodhi) (1.5, 1.11); the list (1.6); the stock formula for each factor (relies on seclusion, fading away and cessation; ripens as letting go) (1.7)." ;
    dho:layer dho:SuttaLayer ;
    dho:leftOut "As they are developed the mind is freed from the defilements of sensuality, desire to be reborn and ignorance, and knows it is freed (1.8-1.10). Needs the three defilements (āsava) as a list and a pattern for release." ;
    dho:modelledBy "project owner with Claude (AI assistant), from SuttaCentral's text" ;
    dho:modelledOn "2026-11-14"^^xsd:date ;
    dho:review dho:Unreviewed ;
    dho:url "https://suttacentral.net/sn46.5/en/sujato"^^xsd:anyURI .

5 a xsd:decimal,
        xsd:integer ;
    owl:sameAs 5 .

"It is the seven awakening factors."@en owl:sameAs "It is the seven awakening factors."@en .

"One of two results: enlightenment in this very life or, if there is residue left behind, non-return."@en owl:sameAs "One of two results: enlightenment in this very life or, if there is residue left behind, non-return."@en .

"There are qualities that are skillful and unskillful, blameworthy and blameless, inferior and superior, and those with a portion of dark or bright."@en owl:sameAs "There are qualities that are skillful and unskillful, blameworthy and blameless, inferior and superior, and those with a portion of dark or bright."@en .

"There are the elements of initiative, persistence, and exertion."@en owl:sameAs "There are the elements of initiative, persistence, and exertion."@en .

"Atthi, bhikkhave, ārambhadhātu nikkamadhātu parakkamadhātu."@pi owl:sameAs "Atthi, bhikkhave, ārambhadhātu nikkamadhātu parakkamadhātu."@pi .

"satta bojjhaṅgā."@pi owl:sameAs "satta bojjhaṅgā."@pi .

"法"@zh owl:sameAs "法"@zh .

