dho:t-sn46.33 a owl:Thing,
        dho:Text ;
    dct:license <https://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/> ;
    dct:source "SuttaCentral bilara-data: English by Bhikkhu Sujato, Pali Mahāsaṅgīti edition" ;
    owl:sameAs dho:t-sn46.33 ;
    skos:prefLabel "SN 46.33 Upakkilesasutta — Corruptions"@en ;
    dho:coverage dho:PartlyEncoded ;
    dho:encodes "The five corruptions of the mind as a list whose members are the same five qualities as the hindrances (2.1, 2.3, 2.4). The simile of the five corruptions of native gold (1.1-1.8, 2.1; D22)." ;
    dho:layer dho:SuttaLayer ;
    dho:leftOut "What the corruptions do: the mind is not pliable, workable or radiant, is brittle, and is not rightly immersed for the ending of defilements (2.1, 2.4): quoted in the simile's point (D22), but no pattern yet for what a quality does." ;
    dho:modelledBy "project owner with Claude (AI assistant), from SuttaCentral's text" ;
    dho:modelledOn "2026-11-14"^^xsd:date ;
    dho:review dho:Unreviewed ;
    dho:url "https://suttacentral.net/sn46.33/en/sujato"^^xsd:anyURI .

dho:t-sn46.37 a owl:Thing,
        dho:Text ;
    dct:license <https://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/> ;
    dct:source "SuttaCentral bilara-data: English by Bhikkhu Sujato, Pali Mahāsaṅgīti edition" ;
    owl:sameAs dho:t-sn46.37 ;
    skos:prefLabel "SN 46.37 Āvaraṇanīvaraṇasutta — Obstacles"@en ;
    dho:coverage dho:PartlyEncoded ;
    dho:encodes "Both lists (1.1, 1.3-1.7; 2.1, 2.3); the hindrances weaken wisdom (1.1, 1.8); developing the awakening factors leads to the realization of the fruit of knowledge and freedom (2.1, 2.4)." ;
    dho:layer dho:SuttaLayer ;
    dho:leftOut "That the hindrances are obstacles and corruptions of the heart, and the awakening factors are not (1.1, 1.8, 2.1, 2.4). Needs a pattern for what a quality is or is not." ;
    dho:modelledBy "project owner with Claude (AI assistant), from SuttaCentral's text" ;
    dho:modelledOn "2026-11-14"^^xsd:date ;
    dho:review dho:Unreviewed ;
    dho:url "https://suttacentral.net/sn46.37/en/sujato"^^xsd:anyURI .

dho:t-sn46.39 a owl:Thing,
        dho:Text ;
    dct:license <https://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/> ;
    dct:source "SuttaCentral bilara-data: English by Bhikkhu Sujato, Pali Mahāsaṅgīti edition" ;
    owl:sameAs dho:t-sn46.39 ;
    skos:prefLabel "SN 46.39 Rukkhasutta — Trees"@en ;
    dho:coverage dho:PartlyEncoded ;
    dho:encodes "Both lists (2.1, 2.3-2.7; 3.1, 3.3); the hindrances, parasites of the mind, weaken wisdom (2.1, 2.8; stated of each hindrance in the Pali only, 2.3-2.7); developing the awakening factors leads to the realization of the fruit of knowledge and freedom (3.1, 3.3-3.4)." ;
    dho:layer dho:SuttaLayer ;
    dho:leftOut "The simile of the large parasitic fig trees whose host trees collapse (1.1-1.4). Its point is a renunciate overcome by sensual pleasures like those he gave up, or worse (1.5), which is not modelled, so under D22 the simile stays out too. That the hindrances are obstacles and the awakening factors are not (2.1, 3.1): no pattern yet for what a quality is or is not (as SN 46.37)." ;
    dho:modelledBy "project owner with Claude (AI assistant), from SuttaCentral's text" ;
    dho:modelledOn "2026-11-16"^^xsd:date ;
    dho:review dho:Unreviewed ;
    dho:url "https://suttacentral.net/sn46.39/en/sujato"^^xsd:anyURI .

dho:t-sn46.40 a owl:Thing,
        dho:Text ;
    dct:license <https://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/> ;
    dct:source "SuttaCentral bilara-data: English by Bhikkhu Sujato, Pali Mahāsaṅgīti edition" ;
    owl:sameAs dho:t-sn46.40 ;
    skos:prefLabel "SN 46.40 Nīvaraṇasutta — Hindrances"@en ;
    dho:coverage dho:PartlyEncoded ;
    dho:encodes "Both lists (1.1, 1.3; 2.1, 2.3); the hindrances block wisdom and don't lead to extinguishment (1.1, 1.8); the awakening factors grow wisdom and lead to extinguishment (2.1, 2.4)." ;
    dho:layer dho:SuttaLayer ;
    dho:leftOut "The Pali compounds 'making blind, sightless, ignorant' and 'on the side of distress' for the hindrances, and their opposites for the awakening factors (1.1, 2.1), which don't map cleanly onto a target concept; and the chapter's summary verse (3.0-3.4)." ;
    dho:modelledBy "project owner with Claude (AI assistant), from SuttaCentral's text" ;
    dho:modelledOn "2026-11-14"^^xsd:date ;
    dho:review dho:Unreviewed ;
    dho:url "https://suttacentral.net/sn46.40/en/sujato"^^xsd:anyURI .

