"The rest of the sutta, which is abbreviated in the Pali (…pe…) and understood to repeat SN 46.57: developing it together with the awakening factors, and the further results. Not expanded here (D14)." owl:sameAs "The rest of the sutta, which is abbreviated in the Pali (…pe…) and understood to repeat SN 46.57: developing it together with the awakening factors, and the further results. Not expanded here (D14)." .

